  "translate_en|mods/traitsAsSkills/42.0/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_TAS_XPLossActiveMultiplier_tooltip": "Multiplies the XP lost through harmful actions while playing (rotten food smoking taking damage). 1.0 normal. 2.0 double. 0.5 half. 0.0 off.",
